<% content_for :page_title, "Before you start" %>

<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Before you start</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
    You are signed in as <strong><%= current_moderator.handle %></strong>. To let
    you moderate here, Waterhole needs to process some data about you, and it
    asks for your consent first.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-6 rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-5">
    <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold">What we process about you</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
      <li>Your Mastodon account identifier, username, display name, avatar and role.</li>
      <li>
        An access token issued by your instance, with which Waterhole acts on
        your behalf: fetching the registration queue and approving or rejecting
        applicants. Every hour it checks with your instance that you may still
        manage users.
      </li>
      <li>When you last signed in, and your sessions, including IP address and browser.</li>
      <li>
        The notes you write, the requests you claim and the decisions you make,
        which your fellow moderators see with your name.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
      The details, how long we keep what, and your rights are in the
      <%= link_to "privacy policy", privacy_path, class: "underline" %>. You can
      withdraw your consent at any time by asking us at the address in the
      <%= link_to "imprint", imprint_path, class: "underline" %>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
    <%= button_to "Agree and continue", consent_path, method: :post,
          class: "rounded bg-stone-900 dark:bg-stone-100 px-4 py-2 font-medium text-white dark:text-stone-900 hover:bg-stone-800 dark:hover:bg-white" %>
    <%= button_to "Decline and delete my data", consent_path, method: :delete,
          form: { data: { turbo_confirm: "Decline? You will be signed out, and we delete what we stored about you." } },
          class: "rounded border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 px-4 py-2 text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:hover:bg-stone-800" %>
  </div>
</div>
